  "content": "<html><head></head><body><p><a href=\"https://laravel-news.com/php-8-6-release-day\"></a></p>\n                                        <hr>\n\n                    <p>PHP 8.6 is out with partial function application, a clamp() function, a Duration class, JSON error locations, readonly property defaults, and new deprecations.</p>\n\n                    <p>The post <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com/php-8-6-release-day\">PHP 8.6 is released! </a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com\">Laravel News</a>.</p>\n                    <p>Join the <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com/newsletter\">Laravel Newsletter</a> to get <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com\">Laravel</a> articles like this directly in your inbox.</p>\n\n                    </body></html>",
